---

<PageNoHeroLayout title={frontmatter.title} carousels={frontmatter.carousels} modals={frontmatter.modals}>
  <div class="content slanted-div default-bg right-facing-bottom-only">
    <div class="container multi-row-section">
      <h1 class="full-width-headline center">Chamber Concerts</h1>
      <p class="full-width">
        ICFA hosts chamber concerts periodically. Unique works of art, dance,
        theatre, etc, are presented to the audience at the center. The performance
        area is fitted with lights and efforts are made to create the black box
        effect with the screens and flooring. The space sits approximately 40
        individuals.
      </p>
      <p class="full-width">
        Several objectives are met through this process. The events are ticketed
        and the performing artists are compensated. Events like such bridge the
        gap between the performer and the audience and bring in a different
        dimension to performing arts by creating a platform for communication. The
        audience gets an insight into the process of the artist and the artist
        gets real time feedback from the audience. The Q&A which follows is a two
        way learning process and makes space for growth.
      </p>
      <p class="full-width">
        Several artists of repute have brought in their work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="multi-row-section container">
      <h2 class="full-width-headline center">
        ICFA Presents Paavai & Preyasi, an evening of dance, music and poetry, exploring two iconic protagonists Godha
        and
        Radha
      </h2>
      <div class="img-wrapper drop-shadow rounded center">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="
          https://res.cloudinary.com/driyengar/image/upload/v1707243458/13th_jan_divya_ravi_tos23c.webp
            "
                  type="image/webp" />
          <source srcset="
          https://res.cloudinary.com/driyengar/image/upload/v1707243305/13th_jan_divya_ravi_keinju.jpg
            "
                  type="image/jpeg" />
          <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/driyengar/image/upload/v1707243458/13th_jan_divya_ravi_tos23c.webp"
               alt="ICFA Presents Paavai & Preyasi, Flyer"
               loading="lazy" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="multi-row-section container">
      <h2 class="full-width-headline center">
        ICFA Presents Paavai & Preyasi, an evening of dance, music and poetry, exploring two iconic protagonists Godha
        and
        Radha
      </h2>
      <div class="img-wrapper drop-shadow rounded center">
